-# Whether the public eoi-form at /admissions is taking EOIs, and if not,
-# why (Admissions::EoiForm.closed_reasons).
- if reasons.any?
  .alert.alert-danger
    The expression-of-interest form at
    = link_to admissions_eoi_form_url, admissions_eoi_form_path
    is closed and saves nothing:
    = succeed '.' do
      = reasons.map { |r| AdmissionsHelper::EOI_FORM_CLOSED_REASONS.fetch(r) }.to_sentence
- else
  %p
    The expression-of-interest form at
    = link_to admissions_eoi_form_url, admissions_eoi_form_path
    is open. New expressions of interest join
    = succeed '.' do
      = link_to Admissions::EoiForm.round.name, admissions_round_path(Admissions::EoiForm.round)
